UPI Transaction Analysis using Excel
Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing UPI transaction data using Microsoft Excel to identify business insights related to:

Transaction performance
Fraud trends
Failed transactions
Customer behavior
Banking and regional analysis

The project demonstrates how Excel can be used for data cleaning, validation, analysis, and dashboard creation for business decision-making.

Objective

The main objectives of this project are:

Analyze UPI transaction trends
Identify fraud-prone patterns
Detect failed transaction issues
Understand customer behavior
Generate business insights using Excel dashboards
